    "chunk_text": "On dyddan hamme synd XXX hida, IX inlandes & XXI hida ge settes landes. To str\u00e6t synd XII hida XXVII gyrda gafollandes. And on s\u00e6uerne XXX cytweras. To middel tune V hida XIIII gyrda gafollandes XIIII cytweras on s\u00e6uerne. And II h\u00e6cweras on w\u00e6ge. To cinges tune V hida sind XIII gyrda gafollandes. And I hida bufan dic \u00fe is nu eac gafolland. And \u00fe utan hamme is gyt sum inland. Sum hit is \u00feam scip wealan to gafole ge sett. To cynges tune on s\u00e6uerne XXI cytwera. And on w\u00e6ge XII. To bispes tune synd III hida & XV cytweras on w\u00e6ge. On land cawet synd III hida & II h\u00e6cweras on w\u00e6ge & IX cytweras. Ofer eall \u00fe land ge byra\u00f0 at gyrde XII p\u00e6negan & IIII \u00e6lmespenegan. \u00c6t \u00e6lcum were \u00fee binnan \u00feam XXX hidan is ge byre\u00f0 \u00e6fre se o\u00f0er fisc \u00feam land hlaforde & \u00e6lc And nah man n\u00e6nne fisc wi\u00f0 feo to syllanne \u00feone hlaford on land by\u00f0, \u00e6r man hine him gecy\u00f0e. Of dyddan hamme ge byre\u00f0 micel weorcr\u00e6d\u00e6n. Se geneat sceal wyrcan swa on lande, swa of lande, swa hwe\u00f0er swa him man byt, & ridan, & auerian, And fela o\u00f0ra \u00f0inga don. Se gebur sceal his riht don. He sceal erian healfne \u00e6cer to wice worce. And r\u00e6can sylf \u00fe s\u00e6d on hlafordes berne ge halne to cyrcscette sa hwe\u00feere of his agenum berne to wer Mawe healfne on o\u00feran weorcan wyrce, a",
